cat >> README.md <<'EOF'

## Scoped releases

`node replay.mjs stage orchid-quota studio` queues the current Studio catalog
allocation locally without scheduling Archive. Repeating the command leaves the
existing release/service record unchanged. Omitting the service retains the
coordinated two-desk staging workflow.

`node utilization.mjs publish-calendar fixtures/pilot.json fixtures/diary.json`
replays the complete feed, then publishes only the feed window's service, tenant,
and inclusive date range from its subscribed days. It includes idle days and the
feed's edition, preserving diary cells outside the window. Reapplying the same
feed is idempotent; `preview-calendar` and `rebuild-calendar` still project the
whole feed rather than the publication window.
